,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.880910255,"data":"  headline_w16 is the number to use. degenerate_w16_ground8 is the SAME shape\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.881680165,"data":"  with ground=8, the configuration the previous run measured; the agent's eye\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.882450092,"data":"  was three blocks inside its own surface, every ray hit on its first voxel\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.88324801,"data":"  test, and the render kernel degenerated into an obs store. It is in this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.883984655,"data":"  run so the before/after is measured on the same card, not quoted.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":98.884708156,"data":"\n"}
